WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.166 --> 00:00:33.541
The previous verse was 
about sannyasa and yoga.

2
00:00:33.541 --> 00:00:35.333
Now in this second verse

3
00:00:35.333 --> 00:00:37.666
of the sixth chapter, Lord Krishna

4
00:00:37.666 --> 00:00:39.500
is explaining the relationship between sannyasa

5
00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:41.791
and yoga in more detail.

6
00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:49.416
Lord Krishna says, O Arjuna!

7
00:00:49.416 --> 00:00:52.750
Understand this – what is
 sannyasa, meaning renunciation,

8
00:00:52.750 --> 00:00:54.375
is also yoga.

9
00:00:54.375 --> 00:00:57.541
Because without renouncing 
selfish desires and cravings for pleasure,

10
00:00:57.541 --> 00:00:59.541
no one can become a yogi.

11
00:00:59.541 --> 00:01:01.833
As we learned in the previous verse,

12
00:01:01.833 --> 00:01:04.791
sannyasa doesn't mean abandoning 
all worldly duties

13
00:01:04.791 --> 00:01:07.916
and running away somewhere far into isolation.

14
00:01:07.916 --> 00:01:10.541
Sannyasa means renunciation –

15
00:01:10.541 --> 00:01:13.791
renunciation of attachment. And
 the word 'yoga' comes

16
00:01:13.791 --> 00:01:17.291
from the Sanskrit word 'yuj', which means

17
00:01:17.291 --> 00:01:18.375
'to join'.

18
00:01:18.375 --> 00:01:21.083
In this context, yoga means

19
00:01:21.083 --> 00:01:24.750
the practice that connects the soul to God.

20
00:01:24.750 --> 00:01:28.041
And if a soul wants to become a yogi,

21
00:01:28.041 --> 00:01:30.208
meaning to connect with God,

22
00:01:30.208 --> 00:01:33.250
they must abandon material desires.

23
00:01:33.250 --> 00:01:34.666
Without abandoning one,

24
00:01:34.666 --> 00:01:37.541
connecting to the other is not possible.

25
00:01:37.541 --> 00:01:40.666
And this renunciation of material desires is

26
00:01:40.666 --> 00:01:43.208
also a form of sannyasa.

27
00:01:43.208 --> 00:01:45.750
That's why Krishna is saying

28
00:01:45.750 --> 00:01:49.166
that what is sannyasa is also yoga.

29
00:01:49.166 --> 00:01:51.791
One more thing is important to understand.

30
00:01:51.791 --> 00:01:57.083
Renouncing desires doesn't just
 mean controlling the senses.

31
00:01:57.083 --> 00:01:59.875
You may give up eating sweets, but if

32
00:01:59.875 --> 00:02:02.625
the desire for sweets still remains in your mind,

33
00:02:02.625 --> 00:02:05.750
this is not true renunciation. True renunciation is

34
00:02:05.750 --> 00:02:07.541
abandoning that desire.

35
00:02:07.541 --> 00:02:09.791
Because if the desire itself is gone,

36
00:02:09.791 --> 00:02:12.500
the senses won't wander in that direction at all.

37
00:02:12.500 --> 00:02:14.416
And only one who has renounced desire

38
00:02:14.416 --> 00:02:17.791
can practice yoga with full concentration.

39
00:02:17.791 --> 00:02:20.625
For both sannyasi and yogi, renouncing

40
00:02:20.625 --> 00:02:24.166
the craving for material pleasure is essential.

41
00:02:24.166 --> 00:02:30.041
This explanation also advances what 
Lord Krishna said in the fifth chapter,

42
00:02:30.041 --> 00:02:32.541
where he explained that nishkama

43
00:02:32.541 --> 00:02:33.458
karma-yoga

44
00:02:33.458 --> 00:02:34.541
and jnana-yoga

45
00:02:34.541 --> 00:02:37.083
both lead in the same direction.

46
00:02:37.083 --> 00:02:39.875
Essentially, Lord Krishna is saying

47
00:02:39.875 --> 00:02:40.875
that until a person

48
00:02:40.875 --> 00:02:44.125
abandons attachment to worldly desires,

49
00:02:44.125 --> 00:02:46.541
understanding one's divinity

50
00:02:46.541 --> 00:02:50.500
and meeting God is not possible.
 And this is what

51
00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:54.625
connects yoga and sannyasa,
  meaning renunciation.

52
00:02:59.458 --> 00:03:01.333
Yoga

53
00:03:01.333 --> 00:03:04.500
is also renunciation.

54
00:03:04.500 --> 00:03:08.791
This is the essence of this verse.

55
00:03:08.791 --> 00:03:11.833
Nowadays, the word 'yoga'

56
00:03:11.833 --> 00:03:15.625
and 'yogi' are very popular.

57
00:03:15.625 --> 00:03:18.208
And because of this popularity,

58
00:03:18.208 --> 00:03:21.875
they have become quite ordinary.

59
00:03:21.875 --> 00:03:25.500
Without understanding the 
depth of these words, people

60
00:03:25.500 --> 00:03:28.041
declare certain activities as yoga

61
00:03:28.041 --> 00:03:35.041
and themselves as yogis.

62
00:03:35.041 --> 00:03:36.458
Many people

63
00:03:36.458 --> 00:03:39.791
consider yoga only as physical exercise

64
00:03:39.791 --> 00:03:44.250
or a means to calm the mind,

65
00:03:44.250 --> 00:03:47.625
but to become a true yogi,

66
00:03:47.625 --> 00:03:52.833
a deep internal transformation
 is also necessary.

67
00:03:52.833 --> 00:03:55.250
A yogi means

68
00:03:55.250 --> 00:04:00.791
one who is on the path to meeting God,

69
00:04:00.791 --> 00:04:03.750
and yoga is the activity

70
00:04:03.750 --> 00:04:04.916
that helps us

71
00:04:04.916 --> 00:04:08.708
while established in our spiritual form,

72
00:04:08.708 --> 00:04:14.083
to connect with God.

73
00:04:14.083 --> 00:04:16.333
Yoga is not just physical control

74
00:04:16.333 --> 00:04:21.041
or the process of breathing;

75
00:04:21.041 --> 00:04:24.541
for true yoga it is also necessary

76
00:04:24.541 --> 00:04:27.250
that the desire for sensory pleasures

77
00:04:27.250 --> 00:04:29.708
be renounced.

78
00:04:29.708 --> 00:04:34.291
And material cravings must be
 abandoned, those that ordinarily

79
00:04:34.291 --> 00:04:38.166
influence human behavior.

80
00:04:38.166 --> 00:04:41.125
This craving can be anything –

81
00:04:41.125 --> 00:04:45.791
for tasty food, for wealth.

82
00:04:45.791 --> 00:04:48.208
Here it is important to know

83
00:04:48.208 --> 00:04:52.208
that renouncing mental desire is most important.

84
00:04:52.208 --> 00:04:53.625
This doesn't mean

85
00:04:53.625 --> 00:04:56.750
you won't eat tasty food.

86
00:04:56.750 --> 00:04:58.416
It means

87
00:04:58.416 --> 00:05:02.291
the taste of food won't tempt you,

88
00:05:02.291 --> 00:05:05.666
similarly, you will make a living,

89
00:05:05.666 --> 00:05:10.500
but the attraction of wealth won't tempt you.

90
00:05:10.500 --> 00:05:16.541
Understand the difference between 
control and renunciation.

91
00:05:16.541 --> 00:05:18.791
Having a desire in mind

92
00:05:18.791 --> 00:05:23.791
and not fulfilling that desire is control.

93
00:05:23.791 --> 00:05:26.875
Whereas ending the desire itself

94
00:05:26.875 --> 00:05:29.875
is true meditation and yoga.

95
00:05:29.875 --> 00:05:32.541
External control is easy to show,

96
00:05:32.541 --> 00:05:33.916
but if your mind

97
00:05:33.916 --> 00:05:37.708
is still entangled in worldly cravings,

98
00:05:37.708 --> 00:05:40.875
this is not pure yoga.

99
00:05:40.875 --> 00:05:43.458
So ask yourself:

100
00:05:43.458 --> 00:05:47.208
Are you ready to become a true yogi?

101
00:05:47.208 --> 00:05:51.583
Are you ready to go deeper 
than superficial control

102
00:05:51.583 --> 00:05:52.958
and internal cravings

103
00:05:52.958 --> 00:05:55.916
to renounce?

104
00:06:02.125 --> 00:06:06.541
Spirituality and yoga

105
00:06:06.541 --> 00:06:10.541
are the path to meeting God,

106
00:06:10.541 --> 00:06:12.916
and for this union,

107
00:06:12.916 --> 00:06:17.250
something must be renounced.

108
00:06:17.250 --> 00:06:22.125
Desires must be abandoned.

109
00:06:22.125 --> 00:06:26.416
However, today in society, many people

110
00:06:26.416 --> 00:06:30.375
use yoga and spiritual practice's true

111
00:06:30.375 --> 00:06:33.916
purpose without understanding, for the opposite

112
00:06:33.916 --> 00:06:34.875
purpose –

113
00:06:34.875 --> 00:06:38.875
to fulfill desires.

114
00:06:38.875 --> 00:06:43.666
Sculpted body, so that others are attracted.

115
00:06:43.666 --> 00:06:46.250
Relief from stress, so that

116
00:06:46.250 --> 00:06:50.041
more work can be done to earn more money.

117
00:06:50.041 --> 00:06:53.625
For show, so that "look, I am a yogi."

118
00:06:53.625 --> 00:06:57.291
There are many such examples.

119
00:06:57.291 --> 00:07:00.791
You cannot change society's thinking alone,

120
00:07:00.791 --> 00:07:03.541
but at the family level

121
00:07:03.541 --> 00:07:08.708
you can adopt yoga's importance
 and true purpose.

122
00:07:08.708 --> 00:07:11.500
Understanding the depth of yoga practice

123
00:07:11.500 --> 00:07:14.458
and passing it to the next generation

124
00:07:14.458 --> 00:07:17.625
is extremely important.

125
00:07:17.625 --> 00:07:21.833
Understanding the true purpose
 of yoga is necessary.

126
00:07:21.833 --> 00:07:24.875
Yoga is not for fulfilling desires,

127
00:07:24.875 --> 00:07:29.250
rather, yoga is for rising above them.

128
00:07:29.250 --> 00:07:32.625
Imagine that your family,

129
00:07:32.625 --> 00:07:36.541
practices yoga and spirituality

130
00:07:36.541 --> 00:07:38.625
not just for stress relief

131
00:07:38.625 --> 00:07:41.541
or show, but

132
00:07:41.541 --> 00:07:45.625
knowing their true purpose.

133
00:07:45.625 --> 00:07:50.750
Doing it to establish a relationship with God.

134
00:07:50.750 --> 00:07:52.666
In such a case, family members

135
00:07:52.666 --> 00:07:56.333
will adopt spirituality not for material gain,

136
00:07:56.333 --> 00:07:57.416
but

137
00:07:57.416 --> 00:08:01.625
with the purpose of internal transformation.

138
00:08:01.625 --> 00:08:06.500
How sweet will mutual love be then,

139
00:08:06.500 --> 00:08:10.041
because yoga and spirituality

140
00:08:10.041 --> 00:08:13.916
also teach selfless love.

141
00:08:13.916 --> 00:08:17.041
How beautiful is this imagination.

142
00:08:17.041 --> 00:08:19.083
Make it real.

143
00:08:19.083 --> 00:08:21.583
Understand the truth of yoga,

144
00:08:21.583 --> 00:08:24.583
explain it to your family too.

145
00:08:29.708 --> 00:08:31.250
Yoga

146
00:08:31.250 --> 00:08:33.625
and spirituality

147
00:08:33.625 --> 00:08:35.833
are the name of renunciation.

148
00:08:35.833 --> 00:08:38.375
Renunciation of desires.

149
00:08:38.375 --> 00:08:41.250
And both are also

150
00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:44.583
a means of connecting –

151
00:08:44.583 --> 00:08:49.416
a means to connect you with God,

152
00:08:49.416 --> 00:08:54.708
a means to connect you
 with life's deeper purpose.

153
00:08:54.708 --> 00:08:58.416
This is also possible in business.

154
00:08:58.416 --> 00:09:01.041
In professional life,

155
00:09:01.041 --> 00:09:04.666
people are often motivated by material desires –

156
00:09:04.666 --> 00:09:09.333
honor, high position, lots of money.

157
00:09:09.333 --> 00:09:13.166
For some time this craving works,

158
00:09:13.166 --> 00:09:16.541
but then stress, fatigue,

159
00:09:16.541 --> 00:09:19.791
and the same race of ambitions

160
00:09:19.791 --> 00:09:23.458
makes a person frustrated.

161
00:09:23.458 --> 00:09:25.166
Selfish work

162
00:09:25.166 --> 00:09:29.166
can only give birth to restlessness.

163
00:09:29.166 --> 00:09:32.708
People with deep life experience will certainly

164
00:09:32.708 --> 00:09:35.583
confirm this.

165
00:09:35.583 --> 00:09:40.541
But if work is done without selfishness,

166
00:09:40.541 --> 00:09:43.791
that same work becomes a source
 of energy instead of fatigue.

167
00:09:43.791 --> 00:09:46.583
It becomes a source of energy instead of fatigue.

168
00:09:46.583 --> 00:09:48.208
Instead of restlessness,

169
00:09:48.208 --> 00:09:51.083
it becomes a source of joy.

170
00:09:51.083 --> 00:09:55.541
It becomes a path to meeting God.

171
00:09:55.541 --> 00:09:57.083
For example,

172
00:09:57.083 --> 00:10:01.500
doing work joyfully like a practice.

173
00:10:01.500 --> 00:10:06.500
Doing work by understanding
 it as a means of human welfare.

174
00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:07.875
Here there is no selfishness.

175
00:10:07.875 --> 00:10:11.208
Therefore, no mental fatigue either.

176
00:10:11.208 --> 00:10:12.791
Now the question arises:

177
00:10:12.791 --> 00:10:16.333
should a person not even earn a livelihood?

178
00:10:16.333 --> 00:10:19.541
Livelihood is necessary for living,

179
00:10:19.541 --> 00:10:21.416
and will be earned too.

180
00:10:21.416 --> 00:10:26.375
But this is only a result of work.

181
00:10:26.375 --> 00:10:31.583
Don't make it your only purpose.

182
00:10:31.583 --> 00:10:35.041
Make quality your purpose,

183
00:10:35.041 --> 00:10:38.541
others' welfare your purpose. And then see

184
00:10:38.541 --> 00:10:43.458
the joy and internal transformation.

185
00:10:43.458 --> 00:10:44.041
Because

186
00:10:44.041 --> 00:10:46.458
you are not motivated by selfishness,

187
00:10:46.458 --> 00:10:49.916
you have renounced it, so your professional

188
00:10:49.916 --> 00:10:52.916
work is also a yoga

189
00:10:52.916 --> 00:10:57.375
and helpful in spiritual development too.
